*****Events and delegate*****
1) while using multicast delegate we are able to do += or -= but 
also = which is able to override that delagate variable and also 
= null removes all methods from delegate which should not happen
that why we use event that make sure = should not be allowed and
throw Compile time error. 
2)in delegate we can also do Invoke 
in some different class but that should not be done as what 
if that event doesnt happens and still u invoke that then all
subsribers will get notification but fact is that nothing happens.